# Day 5 

Today I came across the topic Latency and Throughput

The Latency tells us about the time which is required to provide the output.

Lesser the latency Higher the speed of the response

There are different type of latencies such as P90, P95, P99 which tells the accuracy of the model.

P90 means 90% of response is delivered in the given time and 10% may take higher time

P95 means 95% of response is delivered in the given time and 5% may take higher time

Similarly with P99.

# Throughput

The throughputs tells us about the weight or capacity a server can handel
So Higher the throughput the stronger the server will be.

This two plays important role in giving the information about how good the website or LLM is.

